1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,276
The first minima on each side are at sine theta equals plus or minus lambda over a.

2
00:00:06,276 --> 00:00:12,187
For small angles, the central maximum spans an angle of two lambda over a.

3
00:00:12,187 --> 00:00:17,604
On a screen a distance D away, its width is two lambda D over a.

4
00:00:17,604 --> 00:00:22,643
Or two lambda f over a, in the focal plane of a lens.

